        "size": "large",
        "heading_icon": "_library/hires-icons/打勾清单.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "numbered_steps",
        "text_ref": "1. 普通看图不强制 OCR（光学字符识别）；数字文档有文字层时由外层 AI 优先原生读取。这一步不在 LocalOCR 里，交给 LocalOCR 的 PDF 总是逐页渲染成图片后识别。",
        "columns": 1,
        "icons": "none",
        "illustration": "none",
        "connector": "none"
